.lopez@email.com', 'https://profilepics.com/users/029.jpg', 'https://cvs.com/rachel_lopez_cv.pdf', 'Customer success manager with 5+ years driving client retention and growth. Managed portfolio of 50+ enterprise accounts worth $10M+ in annual recurring revenue. Expert in relationship building, product adoption, and expansion strategies. Achieved 95% customer retention rate and increased upsell revenue by 150%. Strong communication and problem-solving skills. Experience with CRM systems and customer analytics tools. Seeking senior customer success or account management roles.', 'jobseeker', 'e9b7c536-be64-4968-8724-a46a09f4acdd'), ('Automotive', 'Services', 'jobs@automotiveservices.com', 'https://profilepics.com/orgs/099.jpg', '', 'Automotive Services is a full-service auto repair and maintenance company operating multiple locations throughout the region. We provide comprehensive automotive services including engine repair, brake service, tire installation, and preventive maintenance. Our ASE certified technicians use state-of-the-art diagnostic equipment and quality parts. We are committed to honest, reliable service and customer satisfaction. Seeking experienced automotive technicians and service advisors.', 'organization', 'edc4157f-60e6-42b5-a128-4d1f585637fd'), ('Gerald', 'Peterson', 'gerald.peterson@email.com', 'https://profilepics.com/users/070.jpg', 'https://cvs.com/gerald_peterson_cv.pdf', 'Real estate broker with 12+ years in commercial and residential property sales. Licensed broker with expertise in market analysis, property valuation, and negotiation. Generated $100M+ in sales volume while maintaining top producer status at multiple firms. Strong client relationship skills with extensive network of investors, developers, and property owners. Expert in commercial leasing, investment properties, and development projects across various property types.', 'jobseeker', 'ef688d16-c0c4-4b6d-9711-ca68ce65ba07'), ('Robert', 'Wilson', 'robert.wilson@email.com', 'ht