, 'https://cvs.com/tyler_gonzalez_cv.pdf', 'Social media manager with 5+ years building brand presence across digital platforms. Managed social media accounts with 1M+ followers and increased engagement rates by 300%. Expert in content creation, community management, and social media advertising. Strong analytical skills with experience in social media analytics and ROI measurement. Created viral campaigns that generated millions of impressions and drove significant traffic and sales.', 'jobseeker', 'f5e13559-f834-4e19-9dac-e43c956c632b'), ('Education', 'Solutions', 'careers@educationsolutions.com', 'https://profilepics.com/orgs/072.jpg', '', 'Education Solutions is an educational technology company developing learning platforms for K-12 schools and higher education. Our adaptive learning software personalizes instruction for over 1 million students nationwide. We partner with educators to create engaging, effective learning experiences. Our products include assessment tools, curriculum management systems, and virtual classroom platforms. We are passionate about improving educational outcomes through technology. Seeking software developers and educational specialists.', 'organization', 'f700676a-8da3-4184-a80a-3191793d6027');